CON-03: add upstream run-on to LID units only when they fill the subcatchment

SWMMEngine::stepRunoff() added the subcatchment's run-on depth rate to every
LID unit's inflow, copying the 5.3.0 test (area >= lidArea, always true).
The same run-on is spread over the non-LID area and booked there, so a LID
that covers only part of the subcatchment received it twice. Add it only
when the subcatchment has no non-LID area (the area add_runon() divides
by), and use the same rate for the unit's age and temperature mixing.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply CON-03_swmm600.patch

